WEBVTT

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.610
Hey, Annie!

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:15.530
What do you like to eat for lunch?

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:16.790
- I like chee-bur—

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:20.210
- That chee-burg bastard
from the other day was too funny.
- I like chee-bur—

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.290
I mean, since when do you see someone our age
who's still hooked on cheese Hamburg steak?

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.500
I know, right?

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:28.210
Hey, Annie... Annie!

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.300
Hey, Annie!

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:31.260
What? What?

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:34.050
So what do you like to eat for lunch?
You said chee-something.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:34.760
What're you guys talking about?

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.720
What's up?

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:41.440
I-I like ch...

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:43.850
...<i>mozuku</i> seaweed.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.610
Yeah?

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:48.530
You like <i>mozuku</i>?! You're so mature.

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:51.820
The dodgeball tournament is tomorrow!

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:53.610
We'll definitely win!

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.320
Can I say something?

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:59.410
At tomorrow's dodgeball tournament...

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:02.290
I'll use every ounce
of my strength to crush you!

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.540
Prepare yourself!

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:07.960
What's her deal?

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:40.640
Period 3
Dodgeball! Titan Junior High School

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:44.770
Listen, guys! A ball-game
tournament is an important event!

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:48.440
We, Team A from Year 1, Class 4,
will win the championship without fail!

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:53.440
If my splendid plays win the tournament,
I'll be popular among girls for sure!

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:56.530
Ahh! Jean! You're so cool!

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:59.200
The rule for participation
is that every team member plays!

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.490
Is everyone here?!

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:04.160
Now begins my saga of popularity!

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.330
Hm? Armin, where's Eren?

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.540
L-Looks like he overslept.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.210
Damn you, Eren!

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:15.380
My saga of popularity is...!

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:17.380
Jean is noisy today.

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:19.050
He kinda looks like he's enjoying this.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:23.390
At this point, our only option is to try
and cover up the fact that Eren isn't here.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:26.680
I came to see what all this racket is about.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:32.060
Does it have anything to do with the fact
that I don't see Eren Jaeger with you?

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:37.490
He went to the restroom and we
made a racket because Sasha farted.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:38.740
Whaaat?!

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:40.610
You again...

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:45.910
- Mikasa! That wasn't nice!
- Try to learn a little restraint!

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.620
Nice save, Mikasa!

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:49.250
If...!

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:52.380
If I find anyone slacking off...

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:56.880
I'll serve up the whole lot
of you as Titan food.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:02.260
Th-This is too dangerous.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:06.010
At any rate, we've just got to keep
covering up and winning until he comes.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.140
Yep, yep.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:10.190
Dammit! Now that it's come to this,
we'll do our best!

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:11.770
Yeah!

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:16.020
Okay! We'll now begin the dodgeball tournament!

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:20.200
The first match is Class 4,
Team A versus Class 1, Team B!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.860
Are you guys ready?

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:26.410
Let's begin. Go... fight!

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:30.000
I got it! Take this!

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:31.080
All right!

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.000
Conny is stupid, but he's good at sports.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:34.960
If he plays well, he'll be our main attacker.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:36.540
Here, I'm passing the ball.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:37.840
Here you go.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.510
What the hell are you doing, Conny?!

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:42.180
Huh?

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:46.050
He's our opponent's outfield attacker!
Do you know how dodgeball works?

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:47.720
Sorry! What's dodgeball?

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:48.560
Take this!

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:49.060
- Ow!

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:51.310
- Conny and Marco are out!

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:54.270
Look. You need to throw the ball
at our opponent's infield attackers.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:55.270
What're infield attackers?

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:59.110
- Err, that's...
- I never thought that Conny could be
even stupider than I imagined...

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:03.360
Tsk. But at least this means no one
could be as ditzy as he is, right?

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:03.700
- We'll have to somehow get by
with the remaining mem—

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:06.120
- Sasha! What're you doing?!

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.490
What am I doing? I'm eating ramen.

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:12.330
No, that's not what I meant.
Why are you eating it <i>now</i>?!

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:16.000
If it gets cold, it'll be a complete waste,
so I elected to eat it now.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:19.340
No, that's not the point!

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:21.010
There's my opening! Take this!

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.670
Sasha! Watch out!

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:26.260
She dodged it?! Take this!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.850
Take this!

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:32.350
I see! No one can disturb Sasha
while she's eating!

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.890
All the more reason that
I want her to use her hands!

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:38.150
Dammit! What a headache.
Don't we have any decent players?

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:40.820
Oh, that's right! Mikasa! She's definitely...

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:42.110
Take this!

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:47.450
Such a fool! There's no way that a
hopeless ball like that could hit Mika—

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:52.500
What?! She's weak! Why?!
Why the hell is she so weak?!

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.710
The thing is, if Mikasa is separated
from Eren for too long on any given day,

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:58.590
her stats decrease to 30%
of her full capabilities.

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:00.920
Huh?! What the hell's that about?!

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.260
We live in a cruel world.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:04.300
Melancholy so great

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:06.720
that you wouldn't believe she was
in elementary school until recently.

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:09.050
Wh-What the hell is with this team?

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:11.220
- The face-safe rule is...
- An idiot who doesn't know the dodgeball rules...

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:13.560
A girl who eats ramen
in the middle of the game...

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:14.600
- And a girl who somehow or another
is emitting a negative aura!

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:17.020
- It's been a nice life.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:21.360
What the hell's going on?!

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:29.160
Dammit! We managed to win the first match,

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:30.780
but I never thought we'd struggle this much.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:33.450
Yeah. If only Mikasa was in top form...

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:34.580
Ah-choo!

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.410
Armin, what happened to your futon?

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:40.380
Well, Mikasa took it.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:42.590
Sh-She's gotten worse...

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.090
I don't know what to do anymore, either.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.510
Okay!

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:49.970
Annie's team's playing.

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:53.220
The winner of this match
will be our next opponent, huh?

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:57.060
Christa!

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:01.270
You're safe.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:02.860
Thank you, Ymir!

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:05.570
Marry me when this match is over.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:11.910
Dammit!

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:13.790
Annie! Watch out!

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:17.960
Annie! Above you!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.080
What the...?

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:30.510
Take this!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:36.680
Game over! Class 4, Team B wins!

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:38.690
Whaaaaaat?!

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:41.350
Th-There's no way that we could defeat them.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.690
So this is what you call team play.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:46.730
That's right. This is dodgeball.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:51.160
Normally, people don't eat ramen
in the middle of a match!

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:53.320
Has the chee-burg bastard shown up yet?

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:57.120
If he doesn't show up by the time we fight,

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.960
I'm gonna tell Mr. Keith!

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:07.340
As it stands, we'll all become Titan food.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:10.180
Eren, you idiot... Hurry up...

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:12.800
Show up already!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.900
I'm late!

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:28.860
It's lunch time! Eat your lunch!

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:33.030
Annie... I wanna ask you something.

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:35.950
Do you really like <i>mozuku</i>?

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:39.700
Why is she asking that question?!
Does she know chee-burg is my favorite?!

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:40.910
O-Of course.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:43.210
Really?! I'm glad to hear that!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:46.090
The thing is, <i>mozuku</i> is in my lunch today.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:49.760
But I don't like it so I was hoping
that you'd eat it for me.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:53.640
Oh, that was why... No problem.

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:54.840
Annie...

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:58.260
While you're at it,
would you eat my <i>mozuku</i>, too?

00:08:58.470 --> 00:08:59.060
Mine, too.

00:08:59.270 --> 00:08:59.770
Mine, too!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:00.600
Mine, too.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.230
I don't like it, either, so...

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:04.980
<i>Mozuku</i> tastes good! You should eat it!

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:07.940
We are in serious trouble.

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:11.030
As it stands, we're gonna become Titan food.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:14.410
What a dull life this was.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:15.990
If I'd known this would happen,
I would've said—

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.870
I've got a plan.

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:20.750
Huh?

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:21.910
You look exactly like Eren!

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:22.750
Whoa, Jean!

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:25.420
Stop it! No way I look like him!

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:27.130
You two have similar physiques

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:30.000
and have a typical villain's face
with evil eyes, so...

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:30.880
What'd you say?!

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:35.590
Since you really look like Eren,
Mikasa might think you're him and liven up.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.350
No. I don't feel Eren's spirit.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:39.310
What?

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:42.270
So she decides based on
sensing his spirit and stuff?

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:44.310
Sorry to barge in!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:48.570
It's about time for our match.
Chee-burg bastard had better be here.

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.190
- Yeah, Eren's here!

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:51.400
- Hey!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:55.360
I kinda don't think he was horse-faced.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.780
What's your favorite food for lunch?

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:00.330
Huh? That'd be om-om.

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:01.120
Jean!

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.450
Oh, shoot! It's chee-burg!

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.290
Sorry! I overslept.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:09.540
Eren, you son of a bitch!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:10.210
- Eren!

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:10.550
- Ow!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:11.630
My futon!

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.630
Mikasa! Now that I'm here, things will be fine!

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:17.640
Tardiness isn't good.

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:19.140
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:23.850
You're finally here, chee-burg bastard!
I'll crush you with all my might!

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.690
Just bring it on! We will win!

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:29.310
At last, this is the championship match!

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:32.780
It'll be Class 4, Team A versus Class 4 Team B!

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.940
Are you guys ready?!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:37.200
Go... fight!

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:39.370
I got it!

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.580
Annie!

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.540
Leave it to me!

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:44.750
Huh?

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:46.540
What... Hey!

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:49.210
Eren's safe!

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:50.500
How agile she is!

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.420
To think that she changes this much
just because Eren's here...!

00:10:54.260 --> 00:10:55.840
I'm just getting started!

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.140
Eren's safe!

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.140
This time for su—

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:04.560
Eren's safe!

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:08.600
I don't care who it is.
I won't let anyone kill Eren.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.940
Eren's safe!

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.690
Safe again.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.360
Another safe.

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:19.320
Since Mikasa keeps catching the rebound,

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:21.030
he can't even get an out to leave the court.

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:23.910
H-How tragic...

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:24.790
- Ow!

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:26.040
- Jean's out.

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:32.250
Ahh! All in all, Eren and
those two are the only ones left.

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:38.590
I'll end the match with this throw!

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:41.720
All right. Bring it on!

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:56.110
Th-That was an incredible technique.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:59.700
If you like it so much,
I can teach you how to do it.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:02.620
What? No, thanks.
It hurts when the ball hits me.

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:05.990
You don't have to be so modest.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.370
Hey, Annie...

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:13.330
Teach me... how to do it, too.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:18.920
I don't know. This is a technique for humans.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.840
Whoa... A dream match...!

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:23.890
Okay, then! I'll bet all
the croquettes on Mikasa!

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:24.850
I'll bet strawberries!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:26.430
I'll bet a herring. I hate herrings.

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:27.520
I'll bet meatballs!

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:28.850
I'll...

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.480
Now, come at me any time!

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:39.650
Wai—!

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:47.790
Eren!

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.330
Annie... Tell me...

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:53.170
...why you hate me so much.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.630
Th-That's because...

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:08.220
I'll tell you just one time,
so listen carefully.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:11.600
You revealed that you like
chee-burg at the entrance ceremony,

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:15.980
so I couldn't tell anyone that
"I like cheese Hamburg steak" anymore.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:17.860
I wanted to tell everyone.

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:20.690
So that's the reason why I lashed out at you.

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.900
So, that's it, you chee-burg idiot!

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:25.570
What's the problem? Why don't you just say it?

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:26.780
Wha...?!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:32.040
In any case, I'm sorry about that.
We both like chee-burg. Let's get along.

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:38.250
Yeah.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:41.050
Wonderful! They made up.

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:42.260
Yep.

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:49.600
What the hell is this?

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:52.390
Ow, ow, ow... Huh? What's going on?

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:00.940
I finally memorized the ball-dodge rules!

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:04.820
She's out, right?! Right?! Right?!

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:09.160
Annie's out! Game over!

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:14.290
Let's dig in!

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.710
All right! I got a chee-burg in my lunch!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:22.840
Oh nooooo! That was my only chee-burg today!

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:25.050
I forbid you to use the three-second rule.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:26.880
Can I join you guys?

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.300
Sure, no problem.

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:32.640
That's...

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:37.520
Yeah... It was what I was
looking forward to most today, but...

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:40.400
I'll give you one of mine.

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:41.860
Are you sure?!

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:48.280
This is really good!

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:49.950
Thanks, Annie.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:52.620
No problem. But in return,

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:55.500
will you forget what I've do—

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:58.420
Eren, you should eat fish, too.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:14:59.920
What're you doing, Mikasa?!

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:02.040
I'm not your little brother or your kid!

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:04.670
You have to eat.
I <i>won't</i> let you starve to death.

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:06.510
Eren, do you want another one?

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:07.260
Seriously?!

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:09.590
Eren, you should eat vegetables, too.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:11.100
Eren!

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:14.890
These three might end up in a love triangle...

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:22.440
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>climb over that wall</i>

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:28.200
<i>Like a lighthouse, ignite the light of hope</i>

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:33.700
<i>That enormous strength is precisely</i>
<i>what leads the way to freedom</i>

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:39.420
<i>Let's look beyond this conflict, Ausfall!</i>

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:54.510
<i>Inside the wall, with no place to run,</i>

00:15:54.720 --> 00:16:00.190
<i>we're stuck in restrictions and exploits</i>

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:04.730
<i>Even if our glory days of youth</i>
<i>get trampled upon,</i>

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:10.360
<i>I want to at least hold on to the future</i>

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:16.240
<i>I won't give in to that</i>
<i>absurd scolding voice, either</i>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:21.960
<i>I pledged to the earth that I'd make</i>
<i>our dreams and hopes come true</i>

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:27.340
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>the blood in my veins calls forth the future</i>

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:33.140
<i>We'll pull apart all those troublesome rules</i>

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:38.600
<i>Now's the time to raise the flag</i>
<i>of revolt upon that steep wall</i>

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:44.230
<i>Seek prosperity, Ausfall!</i>

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:48.360
Wall Cleanup Club...

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:51.990
Eren and the others were
forced to join a mysterious club.

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:54.450
Still unaware of what to expect from the club,

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:56.990
they headed to their club activities
for the first time.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:57.580
Cleanup! Titan Junior High School

00:16:57.580 --> 00:16:59.660
When they arrived, what they saw there was...
